1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MOM 9A] You did a great job
Mister Ishimori!</b></font>

2
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:10,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your daughter
is so well behaved!</b></font>

3
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MOM 9B]
She's such a good girl!</b></font>

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wish my kids were that sweet.</b></font>

5
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] She was
all the rage of the park!</b></font>

6
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One of the moms said
she was jealous of us!</b></font>

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
Aw!</b></font>

8
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:23,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA'S DAD] Uka.
-[gasps]</b></font>

9
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:25,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your mother and I are
endlessly proud of you.</b></font>

10
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now and always.</b></font>

11
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Uka, put that away!</b></font>

12
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:30,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA (CHILD)]
I wanna help.</b></font>

13
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanted to buy her
a child-safe knife,</b></font>

14
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but for now, letting
mommy's little helper</b></font>

15
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:35,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>use a fruit knife
should be okay.</b></font>

16
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:39,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can't that wait until she's had
a chance to grow up a bit?</b></font>

17
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:41,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't know what I'd do
if something happened</b></font>

18
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to my little girl.</b></font>

19
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, slow down.</b></font>

20
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:46,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can leave
all the difficult stuff to us.</b></font>

21
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:49,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're gonna be class rep?</b></font>

22
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:50,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To what purpose?</b></font>

23
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not quite sure.</b></font>

24
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:54,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The other students
nominated me.</b></font>

25
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
That sounds like a lot of work.</b></font>

26
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:57,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't overwhelm yourself.</b></font>

27
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The title wouldn't even help
school applications much,</b></font>

28
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:02,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I'll tell your teacher
to assign someone else.</b></font>

29
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:06,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just let your old man
handle everything.</b></font>

30
00:01:06,190 --> 00:01:08,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll make sure
it all works out perfectly!</b></font>

31
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:11,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He does this...for me.</b></font>

32
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:14,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm headed out!</b></font>

33
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
See you later!</b></font>

34
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:17,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

35
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:18,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
All my life,</b></font>

36
00:01:18,830 --> 00:01:20,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my world has felt so small.</b></font>

37
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wrapped in my cocoon,</b></font>

38
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>safe and sound.</b></font>

39
00:02:55,380 --> 00:02:57,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good morning, Uka!</b></font>

40
00:02:57,510 --> 00:02:59,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Uka gasps]
-[AYUMI] Gimme some love!</b></font>

41
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:00,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

42
00:03:00,850 --> 00:03:02,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Whoops.
-[Satoru chuckles]</b></font>

43
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think we might've broken her!</b></font>

44
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:05,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

45
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I hope all my lovely pupils</b></font>

46
00:03:07,350 --> 00:03:09,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>had a nice time
over summer break!</b></font>

47
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:11,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why do we have to be here?</b></font>

48
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got stuck
in my nocturnal mode.</b></font>

49
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:17,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, at least none of you
decided to drop out this year.</b></font>

50
00:03:17,450 --> 00:03:18,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hmm.
-[gasps]</b></font>

51
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:20,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
Miura? Miura?</b></font>

52
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:23,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, don't leave us!</b></font>

53
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:25,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not dropping out,
so stop yelling at me.</b></font>

54
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:27,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
Overslept on the first day?</b></font>

55
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:28,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Yeah.</b></font>

56
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

57
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

58
00:03:32,130 --> 00:03:33,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

59
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

60
00:03:35,220 --> 00:03:36,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good morning!</b></font>

61
00:03:36,970 --> 00:03:38,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hi!
Good morning!</b></font>

62
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:41,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[trembling]
And, uh, welcome.</b></font>

63
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:44,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKINO]
Dude, where did that come from?</b></font>

64
00:03:44,220 --> 00:03:45,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I dunno.</b></font>

65
00:03:45,390 --> 00:03:47,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's part of my morning ritual.</b></font>

66
00:03:47,230 --> 00:03:48,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gotta say hi to Ishimori.</b></font>

67
00:03:48,850 --> 00:03:49,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAGANO]
But why?</b></font>

68
00:03:49,940 --> 00:03:50,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Nah, I get it!</b></font>

69
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:53,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The day doesn't really
start until you see her.</b></font>

70
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like, "Yep,
I'm ready for school now."</b></font>

71
00:03:55,780 --> 00:03:57,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Right?
She's like our personal Jizo</b></font>

72
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:59,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>watching over our class!</b></font>

73
00:03:59,110 --> 00:04:00,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai chuckles]</b></font>

74
00:04:01,530 --> 00:04:03,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nice start to your second term.</b></font>

75
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:04,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

76
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

77
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:08,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] At some point,
my little girl grew up</b></font>

78
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:10,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and stopped holding
her dad's hand.</b></font>

79
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:12,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

80
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

81
00:04:15,170 --> 00:04:16,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I've tried.</b></font>

82
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] When you get home,
ask your dad</b></font>

83
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:19,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you can download an app.</b></font>

84
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
But for some reason,</b></font>

85
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't been able
to ask him yet.</b></font>

86
00:04:24,770 --> 00:04:27,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] We actually
got out early today!</b></font>

87
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:28,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Let's karaoke!</b></font>

88
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:29,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Ah! It's perfect!</b></font>

89
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:32,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All of us wanted to find a time
before your curfew</b></font>

90
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to hang out after class!</b></font>

91
00:04:34,230 --> 00:04:36,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We actually talked about you
a lot over summer break!</b></font>

92
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:39,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our class wouldn't be
the same without ya!</b></font>

93
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:41,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka chuckles]</b></font>

94
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I don't know why,</b></font>

95
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:44,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it still bothers me.</b></font>

96
00:04:45,910 --> 00:04:47,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
We're here.</b></font>

97
00:04:47,450 --> 00:04:48,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
There it is!</b></font>

98
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>KARAOKE CENTER</b></font>

99
00:04:49,710 --> 00:04:52,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look at how many different
rooms they have!</b></font>

100
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And drinks too?</b></font>

101
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be careful not to get lost.</b></font>

102
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[yawns]</b></font>

103
00:04:57,510 --> 00:04:59,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you not sleep well
last night?</b></font>

104
00:04:59,170 --> 00:05:00,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

105
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Couldn't stop thinking.</b></font>

106
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles softly]
About what?</b></font>

107
00:05:03,890 --> 00:05:06,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-The girl in front of me.
-[gasps]</b></font>

108
00:05:06,350 --> 00:05:07,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[trembling]</b></font>

109
00:05:10,730 --> 00:05:12,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just kidding.</b></font>

110
00:05:12,190 --> 00:05:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[nervous chuckle]</b></font>

111
00:05:13,730 --> 00:05:15,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

112
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Hey, Uka!</b></font>

113
00:05:19,570 --> 00:05:20,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's get in there!</b></font>

114
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TEACHER 9A] What do you think
you're doing here?</b></font>

115
00:05:22,110 --> 00:05:23,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ah?
-Hm?</b></font>

116
00:05:23,410 --> 00:05:26,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-We are really sorry!
-[TEACHER 9A] Name and class?</b></font>

117
00:05:26,330 --> 00:05:27,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Isn't that the uniform
from Shinsei?</b></font>

118
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:28,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TEACHER 9A] You already
know what the rules are.</b></font>

119
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Didn't think girls from
such a prestigious school</b></font>

120
00:05:31,290 --> 00:05:32,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would come here.</b></font>

121
00:05:32,670 --> 00:05:35,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka, isn't that the place
you were gonna go?</b></font>

122
00:05:35,590 --> 00:05:37,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
But you went with Hachimitsu?</b></font>

123
00:05:37,210 --> 00:05:38,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's a...choice.</b></font>

124
00:05:40,130 --> 00:05:43,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] I know Shinsei will
be the perfect fit for you.</b></font>

125
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:45,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Their curriculum
and their principles</b></font>

126
00:05:45,180 --> 00:05:46,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are all top notch.</b></font>

127
00:05:46,350 --> 00:05:48,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it's a girls-only
establishment,</b></font>

128
00:05:48,180 --> 00:05:50,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so you won't encounter
the wrong types of boys.</b></font>

129
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't answer anything?</b></font>

130
00:05:53,310 --> 00:05:55,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What came over you
during the test?</b></font>

131
00:05:55,940 --> 00:05:57,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our dream's over.</b></font>

132
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:59,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shinsei doesn't do make-ups.</b></font>

133
00:05:59,610 --> 00:06:02,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have no choice left
but to go to Hachimitsu.</b></font>

134
00:06:03,910 --> 00:06:05,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SUBORDINATE 9A]
Wow, high schoolers sure</b></font>

135
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:07,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are different than in my day.</b></font>

136
00:06:07,660 --> 00:06:09,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How bad of a parent
do you have to be</b></font>

137
00:06:09,290 --> 00:06:10,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to let your kids go out
looking like that?</b></font>

138
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:14,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I ask myself the same question
about our youth all the time.</b></font>

139
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:17,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, those are
Hachimitsu uniforms.</b></font>

140
00:06:17,090 --> 00:06:18,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yeah, that makes sense,</b></font>

141
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>since the rules
are supposedly lax there.</b></font>

142
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What parent would let their--</b></font>

143
00:06:22,010 --> 00:06:24,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My daughter attends Hachimitsu.</b></font>

144
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:27,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Sorry, sir.
-It's okay.</b></font>

145
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

146
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:33,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

147
00:06:33,810 --> 00:06:34,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

148
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:36,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

149
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:37,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SUBORDINATE 9A]
Sir?</b></font>

150
00:06:37,690 --> 00:06:38,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's wrong?</b></font>

151
00:06:38,770 --> 00:06:39,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nothing.</b></font>

152
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:41,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My kid's different.</b></font>

153
00:06:41,780 --> 00:06:42,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
What's up?</b></font>

154
00:06:42,990 --> 00:06:44,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You okay?</b></font>

155
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:45,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I learned...</b></font>

156
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:48,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I can walk on my own.</b></font>

157
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] You can leave
all the difficult stuff to us.</b></font>

158
00:06:51,450 --> 00:06:53,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Gotta see it through
to the end.</b></font>

159
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:54,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Don't overwhelm yourself.</b></font>

160
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:57,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
'Cause ya can't just quit.</b></font>

161
00:06:57,670 --> 00:06:58,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You make the rules now.</b></font>

162
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

163
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:03,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He taught me I can be more.</b></font>

164
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:04,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That I'm not helpless.</b></font>

165
00:07:05,050 --> 00:07:07,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My world's been reborn.</b></font>

166
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:09,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My values are changing.</b></font>

167
00:07:09,140 --> 00:07:10,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
You have no choice left</b></font>

168
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:12,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but to go to Hachimitsu.</b></font>

169
00:07:12,310 --> 00:07:14,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Our class wouldn't be
the same without ya!</b></font>

170
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:17,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I belong somewhere,</b></font>

171
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:20,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but dad doesn't approve.</b></font>

172
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:22,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not pushing him away,</b></font>

173
00:07:22,230 --> 00:07:24,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but...</b></font>

174
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura?</b></font>

175
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be honest with me.</b></font>

176
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:29,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I betraying my dad's trust?</b></font>

177
00:07:31,290 --> 00:07:32,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Uka...</b></font>

178
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>your mother and I are
endlessly proud of you.</b></font>

179
00:07:35,410 --> 00:07:37,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now and always.</b></font>

180
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:39,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
Welcome home.</b></font>

181
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is Uka back in her room?</b></font>

182
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
She's here.</b></font>

183
00:07:42,590 --> 00:07:43,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

184
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I hope everything
went well at work, Dad.</b></font>

185
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:47,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I, uh...</b></font>

186
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:50,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She told me she went to sing
karaoke after her classes!</b></font>

187
00:07:50,890 --> 00:07:52,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What a day!</b></font>

188
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:54,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With whom?</b></font>

189
00:07:54,350 --> 00:07:56,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With my friends.</b></font>

190
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Those are your friends?</b></font>

191
00:07:58,190 --> 00:07:59,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[clearing throat]</b></font>

192
00:07:59,810 --> 00:08:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would expect you
to keep better company.</b></font>

193
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You shouldn't hang out
with delinquents like that.</b></font>

194
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

195
00:08:05,530 --> 00:08:07,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] You should
really find suitable friends.</b></font>

196
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:09,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ones, a bit more respectable.</b></font>

197
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

198
00:08:10,530 --> 00:08:12,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...they are respectable!</b></font>

199
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:14,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Well, you could've fooled me.</b></font>

200
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Please, Dad.</b></font>

201
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka, you're done there.</b></font>

202
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't let you
go to Hachimitsu.</b></font>

203
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll be transferring.</b></font>

204
00:08:28,590 --> 00:08:31,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold on.
Uka's not here yet?</b></font>

205
00:08:31,260 --> 00:08:33,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you think she might've
come down with something?</b></font>

206
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not one to cut class.</b></font>

207
00:08:35,470 --> 00:08:37,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYAKA]
Oh, morning, Mr. Abe.</b></font>

208
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:40,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU] Yo, teach!
Ishimori stayin' home today?</b></font>

209
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:43,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Yeah!
Did ya hear from her folks?</b></font>

210
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:46,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Abe? Hey!</b></font>

211
00:08:47,190 --> 00:08:48,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>C'mon, bro.</b></font>

212
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

213
00:08:49,450 --> 00:08:52,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently, Ishimori's absent
for the indefinite future.</b></font>

214
00:08:52,490 --> 00:08:53,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

215
00:08:53,580 --> 00:08:54,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Say what?</b></font>

216
00:08:54,990 --> 00:08:56,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just got out
of an impromptu meeting</b></font>

217
00:08:56,950 --> 00:08:58,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with her father.</b></font>

218
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:01,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He wants her to drop out
of Hachimitsu High.</b></font>

219
00:09:01,380 --> 00:09:02,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

220
00:09:05,050 --> 00:09:06,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

221
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:08,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
You'll be transferring.</b></font>

222
00:09:08,340 --> 00:09:10,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hachimitsu fails my standards.</b></font>

223
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:12,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My daughter deserves better.</b></font>

224
00:09:12,850 --> 00:09:14,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, Dad, you can't!</b></font>

225
00:09:14,470 --> 00:09:15,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't wanna transfer!</b></font>

226
00:09:15,970 --> 00:09:17,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It isn't good for you
to hang out</b></font>

227
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:18,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with miscreants like those.</b></font>

228
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:20,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] It is.
-You would be seen</b></font>

229
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>around a boy like that?</b></font>

230
00:09:23,310 --> 00:09:24,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You mean Miura?</b></font>

231
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's the most important person
in the world to me.</b></font>

232
00:09:26,780 --> 00:09:28,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't lose him like this!</b></font>

233
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:30,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can't decide
what's right for me.</b></font>

234
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:32,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's so many things
you don't know!</b></font>

235
00:09:32,780 --> 00:09:33,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

236
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:35,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

237
00:09:37,450 --> 00:09:39,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

238
00:09:39,250 --> 00:09:41,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
I'm pulling you out of school.</b></font>

239
00:09:41,290 --> 00:09:44,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Use this time
to think carefully.</b></font>

240
00:09:44,130 --> 00:09:46,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Just when things
were finally getting better.</b></font>

241
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:48,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

242
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:49,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
You're joking, right?</b></font>

243
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:52,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-She's transferring?
-But why?</b></font>

244
00:09:52,130 --> 00:09:55,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He said our school
isn't conducive to her growth.</b></font>

245
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:56,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKINO]
In second term?</b></font>

246
00:09:56,470 --> 00:09:58,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Furthermore,
that our class has said</b></font>

247
00:09:58,810 --> 00:10:01,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>some unacceptable things
to Ishimori.</b></font>

248
00:10:02,190 --> 00:10:03,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That she's been bullied.</b></font>

249
00:10:03,770 --> 00:10:05,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKINO]
He thinks we're bullying her?</b></font>

250
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:07,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why would he think that?</b></font>

251
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:09,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's been called names.</b></font>

252
00:10:09,690 --> 00:10:11,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Some were comparing her
to a stone.</b></font>

253
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:14,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Some teased her
for being quiet.</b></font>

254
00:10:14,110 --> 00:10:15,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I've been told
she was mocked</b></font>

255
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:17,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for having a 5 o'clock curfew.</b></font>

256
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:18,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

257
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:20,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We haven't been
laughing at her!</b></font>

258
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What the hell?
Like we'd do that!</b></font>

259
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:24,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe all that
came from Ishimori's dad.</b></font>

260
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:26,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you're gonna get
on our backs about anything,</b></font>

261
00:10:26,750 --> 00:10:29,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at least find something
we legit did.</b></font>

262
00:10:29,170 --> 00:10:31,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAGANO]
Is Ishimori saying that, too?</b></font>

263
00:10:31,130 --> 00:10:32,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Absolutely not!</b></font>

264
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka knows how much
we care about her,</b></font>

265
00:10:35,430 --> 00:10:37,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and she would never
say stuff like that!</b></font>

266
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:40,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SHIRAISHI] Hold on!
-[TAO] We'll come, too!</b></font>

267
00:10:40,930 --> 00:10:43,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, wait!
Class isn't over yet, you know?</b></font>

268
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:44,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Calm down!</b></font>

269
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:46,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

270
00:10:46,190 --> 00:10:48,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her father's getting
in her way.</b></font>

271
00:10:48,230 --> 00:10:49,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Poor Uka.</b></font>

272
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

273
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] Pardon!
-[UKA'S DAD] Ah?</b></font>

274
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:56,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're Uka's dad, aren't you?</b></font>

275
00:10:57,740 --> 00:10:59,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's been a horrible
misunderstanding!</b></font>

276
00:11:00,410 --> 00:11:02,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've never said a bad word
about your daughter!</b></font>

277
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:06,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kids in another class
already told me everything.</b></font>

278
00:11:06,580 --> 00:11:09,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise we can explain this
if you just give us a chance!</b></font>

279
00:11:09,590 --> 00:11:11,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Please, save your breath.</b></font>

280
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

281
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:15,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Bro, do you really
not understand</b></font>

282
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:17,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the difference between laughing
at someone and with them?</b></font>

283
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:18,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
Stop it, Tonbo!</b></font>

284
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:22,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That difference is something
I'll decide for her.</b></font>

285
00:11:22,430 --> 00:11:24,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And "bro?"</b></font>

286
00:11:24,180 --> 00:11:25,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should call me "sir."</b></font>

287
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:28,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise, if you heard about
her getting bullied,</b></font>

288
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:30,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>all that happened
in junior high.</b></font>

289
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't lump all of us together
with those twerps.</b></font>

290
00:11:32,940 --> 00:11:34,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh?</b></font>

291
00:11:34,570 --> 00:11:35,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quit lying.</b></font>

292
00:11:35,780 --> 00:11:38,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If she was bullied then,
I would know.</b></font>

293
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:40,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She went to school
happy as could be.</b></font>

294
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:43,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Every day for three years.
Never skipped.</b></font>

295
00:11:43,370 --> 00:11:44,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, then...</b></font>

296
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:46,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I believe you're missing
your classes.</b></font>

297
00:11:46,790 --> 00:11:48,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Say goodbye to Uka.</b></font>

298
00:11:48,710 --> 00:11:50,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She'll never associate
with you again.</b></font>

299
00:11:51,550 --> 00:11:53,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Don't make her go!
-Let's step back!</b></font>

300
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We only made things worse here.</b></font>

301
00:11:55,630 --> 00:11:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This backfired on us.</b></font>

302
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:58,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I don't get it.</b></font>

303
00:11:58,590 --> 00:12:00,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How did he not know
about the bullying?</b></font>

304
00:12:00,930 --> 00:12:02,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All that time?</b></font>

305
00:12:03,850 --> 00:12:05,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!
[sighs]</b></font>

306
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:09,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[beeping]</b></font>

307
00:12:09,860 --> 00:12:12,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What did you tell my daughter
to brainwash her?</b></font>

308
00:12:12,770 --> 00:12:14,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's been changing on her own.</b></font>

309
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Stay away from Uka.</b></font>

310
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, that's it, then.</b></font>

311
00:12:20,950 --> 00:12:22,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're putting her
back in her cage?</b></font>

312
00:12:23,990 --> 00:12:26,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shut your mouth,
you little pissant.</b></font>

313
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My daughter doesn't need you.</b></font>

314
00:12:30,710 --> 00:12:31,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
Honey, look!</b></font>

315
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There!
She passed!</b></font>

316
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:36,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I'm so proud of you, Uka!
-[chuckles]</b></font>

317
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:38,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

318
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:42,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

319
00:12:42,890 --> 00:12:44,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

320
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:45,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

321
00:12:45,810 --> 00:12:46,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

322
00:12:47,060 --> 00:12:48,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Ayumi! Miura!</b></font>

323
00:12:50,270 --> 00:12:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Was that to us?</b></font>

324
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:53,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] I dunno know.
Is she a friend of yours?</b></font>

325
00:12:53,230 --> 00:12:55,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think
I've ever seen her before.</b></font>

326
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

327
00:12:56,530 --> 00:12:58,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
You, Kai?</b></font>

328
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Not a clue.
-[gasps]</b></font>

329
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:01,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

330
00:13:01,870 --> 00:13:03,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was just a dream,</b></font>

331
00:13:03,830 --> 00:13:06,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it felt
so painfully realistic.</b></font>

332
00:13:06,410 --> 00:13:07,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

333
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:08,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[phone vibrating]</b></font>

334
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:09,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

335
00:13:09,870 --> 00:13:11,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>AYUMI CALLING</b></font>

336
00:13:11,670 --> 00:13:12,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

337
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:17,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hello?
-[AYUMI] You answered!</b></font>

338
00:13:17,590 --> 00:13:20,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] I'm so relieved!
-Good to hear your voi--</b></font>

339
00:13:20,260 --> 00:13:22,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] You're not really
transferring schools?</b></font>

340
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:24,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please, don't leave me.</b></font>

341
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:25,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[weeping]
I'll miss you so much.</b></font>

342
00:13:25,850 --> 00:13:26,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

343
00:13:26,930 --> 00:13:28,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ishimori?
-Speaker, girl!</b></font>

344
00:13:28,730 --> 00:13:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO] Why are you letting
him push you around?</b></font>

345
00:13:29,850 --> 00:13:31,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't go.</b></font>

346
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:32,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Get it together!</b></font>

347
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:35,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Are you still there?</b></font>

348
00:13:35,150 --> 00:13:37,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I want to stay here.</b></font>

349
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:39,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Who are you talking to?</b></font>

350
00:13:39,530 --> 00:13:41,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] No one!
-I'll take that.</b></font>

351
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:44,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know you're upset.</b></font>

352
00:13:44,530 --> 00:13:45,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But please, listen.</b></font>

353
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My classmates
are important to me.</b></font>

354
00:13:49,330 --> 00:13:51,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They've helped me so much!</b></font>

355
00:13:51,290 --> 00:13:53,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No matter what, I can't just
lose them like this!</b></font>

356
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:56,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't!
I refuse to transfer schools!</b></font>

357
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

358
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:02,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Understood.</b></font>

359
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:05,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've made
your feelings clear.</b></font>

360
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:09,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You obviously don't care
about your father anymore...</b></font>

361
00:14:10,230 --> 00:14:11,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so do what you want.</b></font>

362
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:13,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll hold on
to your phone for now.</b></font>

363
00:14:13,900 --> 00:14:15,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door closes]</b></font>

364
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No.</b></font>

365
00:14:18,030 --> 00:14:20,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

366
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[VOICE 9A]
The phone you have called</b></font>

367
00:14:21,450 --> 00:14:23,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is either out of range
or has been powered off.</b></font>

368
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:25,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please try again
at a later time.</b></font>

369
00:14:25,660 --> 00:14:27,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

370
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:31,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Have I become too greedy?</b></font>

371
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:33,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Will I have to give up
one thing to protect another?</b></font>

372
00:14:35,130 --> 00:14:37,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do I really have to decide
what I'm ready to lose?</b></font>

373
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:41,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What would Miura say
about this?</b></font>

374
00:14:41,170 --> 00:14:43,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[tapping on window]
-Hm?</b></font>

375
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:45,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

376
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:48,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good, you're up.</b></font>

377
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:49,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

378
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

379
00:14:51,180 --> 00:14:52,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Hey!</b></font>

380
00:14:54,980 --> 00:14:56,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

381
00:14:56,190 --> 00:14:57,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai chuckles]</b></font>

382
00:14:57,610 --> 00:14:58,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it raining?</b></font>

383
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:00,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

384
00:15:00,610 --> 00:15:02,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...your phone's off.</b></font>

385
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:04,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did he take it?</b></font>

386
00:15:04,110 --> 00:15:06,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.
I'm sorry.</b></font>

387
00:15:06,530 --> 00:15:07,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

388
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:08,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did ya hear?</b></font>

389
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:10,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He came down
to the school today.</b></font>

390
00:15:10,700 --> 00:15:12,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What'd he say?</b></font>

391
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nothing much.</b></font>

392
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:17,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just accused us
of bullying his daughter.</b></font>

393
00:15:17,130 --> 00:15:18,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

394
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:21,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Guess "banter"
and "bullying" sound alike.</b></font>

395
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:24,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We tried to tell him,
but...he wouldn't listen.</b></font>

396
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:26,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

397
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:27,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I made everyone feel bad.</b></font>

398
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:29,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This should've only
affected me!</b></font>

399
00:15:29,810 --> 00:15:31,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crying]</b></font>

400
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:33,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...I don't know
who I'm supposed</b></font>

401
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:34,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to hold on to anymore.</b></font>

402
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Hold on to everyone.</b></font>

403
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

404
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:40,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have a dad
who cares about you.</b></font>

405
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:43,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You made friends
with your entire class.</b></font>

406
00:15:43,190 --> 00:15:45,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
It's all important.</b></font>

407
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:48,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...you'll just
have to hold on to both.</b></font>

408
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:49,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got it?</b></font>

409
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:52,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

410
00:15:52,330 --> 00:15:53,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

411
00:15:54,330 --> 00:15:56,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Good.
Feeling better?</b></font>

412
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

413
00:15:58,250 --> 00:16:00,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You ready to take care of it?</b></font>

414
00:16:00,210 --> 00:16:01,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

415
00:16:01,420 --> 00:16:02,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Good girl.</b></font>

416
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:04,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well...I'm going home.</b></font>

417
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:06,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

418
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:07,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

419
00:16:07,890 --> 00:16:09,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Good girl?"</b></font>

420
00:16:09,180 --> 00:16:10,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did I really say that?</b></font>

421
00:16:10,970 --> 00:16:12,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who am I supposed to be to you?</b></font>

422
00:16:13,310 --> 00:16:14,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
You're the man that I love.</b></font>

423
00:16:15,890 --> 00:16:17,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...how are you gonna
get back down--</b></font>

424
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:19,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll just sprout wings.</b></font>

425
00:16:20,060 --> 00:16:22,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't wait to see
what you're gonna do next.</b></font>

426
00:16:23,570 --> 00:16:24,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>GOODBYE, BUMBLING DAYS</b></font>

427
00:16:24,570 --> 00:16:26,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Hey, Mom, where's Dad?</b></font>

428
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:29,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM] Huh?
I guess he went out on a walk.</b></font>

429
00:16:29,110 --> 00:16:30,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was here a second ago.</b></font>

430
00:16:30,780 --> 00:16:32,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, hey, what's up?</b></font>

431
00:16:32,410 --> 00:16:33,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

432
00:16:33,540 --> 00:16:35,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He takes walks when he's upset.</b></font>

433
00:16:35,660 --> 00:16:36,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know his route.</b></font>

434
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:38,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can catch him!</b></font>

435
00:16:38,830 --> 00:16:41,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll tell him...for their sake.</b></font>

436
00:16:41,380 --> 00:16:42,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And for his!</b></font>

437
00:16:44,250 --> 00:16:46,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Ayumi, try not to freak out.</b></font>

438
00:16:46,970 --> 00:16:48,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
What do you expect me to do?</b></font>

439
00:16:48,430 --> 00:16:50,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka might actually
get transferred</b></font>

440
00:16:50,140 --> 00:16:52,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if we don't do
something to help her!</b></font>

441
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:53,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
I get it, girl.</b></font>

442
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:55,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's not our place
to jump in the middle of that.</b></font>

443
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:58,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] Not like any of us
understand the relationship</b></font>

444
00:16:58,850 --> 00:17:00,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she has with her parents.</b></font>

445
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, if mine did
something like that,</b></font>

446
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:03,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd never go back home.</b></font>

447
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:06,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]
I'm still a little curious.</b></font>

448
00:17:06,690 --> 00:17:08,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why didn't she tell them
that she was being bullied</b></font>

449
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:09,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in junior high?</b></font>

450
00:17:09,990 --> 00:17:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

451
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:13,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Maybe she thought
they'd freak out.</b></font>

452
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:15,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or she didn't
want to burden them.</b></font>

453
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:17,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, she suffered alone,
instead.</b></font>

454
00:17:18,290 --> 00:17:20,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All that time,
she was putting on a fake smile</b></font>

455
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to convince them she was fine.</b></font>

456
00:17:22,710 --> 00:17:25,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But now she can tell them
what she thinks!</b></font>

457
00:17:26,130 --> 00:17:28,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna be there
with her, fighting!</b></font>

458
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:31,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She and I feel the same way,</b></font>

459
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:33,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I can't just watch!</b></font>

460
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:35,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll see, I'm gonna go
bring her back to us!</b></font>

461
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YURU] Wait. Ayumi!
-[SHIRAISHI] Slow down!</b></font>

462
00:17:38,930 --> 00:17:40,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
We'll come too!</b></font>

463
00:17:40,190 --> 00:17:42,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Shiraishi and Tao panting]</b></font>

464
00:17:42,150 --> 00:17:44,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, where are you and I going?</b></font>

465
00:17:44,310 --> 00:17:46,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

466
00:17:46,730 --> 00:17:48,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I was always lying.</b></font>

467
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:51,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I said something,</b></font>

468
00:17:51,910 --> 00:17:54,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought that would only serve
to make my parents sad.</b></font>

469
00:17:55,330 --> 00:17:56,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, I didn't.</b></font>

470
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For where I was...</b></font>

471
00:17:59,330 --> 00:18:00,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that was the best I could do.</b></font>

472
00:18:01,870 --> 00:18:02,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...</b></font>

473
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He isn't here.</b></font>

474
00:18:04,380 --> 00:18:06,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe he got further ahead
of me than I...</b></font>

475
00:18:07,300 --> 00:18:08,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

476
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:13,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
But now?</b></font>

477
00:18:14,090 --> 00:18:15,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look, this way!</b></font>

478
00:18:15,850 --> 00:18:17,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Uka!</b></font>

479
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:19,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Things are different,</b></font>

480
00:18:19,930 --> 00:18:21,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I can do better!</b></font>

481
00:18:22,850 --> 00:18:24,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to tell you.</b></font>

482
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:26,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I lied.</b></font>

483
00:18:26,860 --> 00:18:28,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back in junior high,</b></font>

484
00:18:28,650 --> 00:18:30,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was bullied every day.</b></font>

485
00:18:30,570 --> 00:18:31,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

486
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:32,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

487
00:18:32,910 --> 00:18:34,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
Oh!</b></font>

488
00:18:35,070 --> 00:18:36,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All those years,</b></font>

489
00:18:36,660 --> 00:18:38,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't have a single friend.</b></font>

490
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:42,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Every day was more miserable
than the last.</b></font>

491
00:18:42,290 --> 00:18:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[whimpering]
-[UKA] But...I kept it from you</b></font>

492
00:18:44,630 --> 00:18:45,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so you wouldn't know.</b></font>

493
00:18:47,130 --> 00:18:48,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...I'm sorry.</b></font>

494
00:18:48,750 --> 00:18:50,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

495
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:52,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But now it's all right, and--</b></font>

496
00:18:52,090 --> 00:18:53,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA'S DAD] When did it start?
-[gasps]</b></font>

497
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:57,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why did you think
you couldn't tell us about it?</b></font>

498
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:58,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh, no.</b></font>

499
00:18:59,850 --> 00:19:01,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't mean
to lead with that.</b></font>

500
00:19:02,730 --> 00:19:04,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Mind if I butt in?</b></font>

501
00:19:04,690 --> 00:19:06,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Most of the crap
she's talking about</b></font>

502
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:08,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>came from me.</b></font>

503
00:19:08,190 --> 00:19:10,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
You're her bullies?</b></font>

504
00:19:10,190 --> 00:19:12,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] How about listening
for a sec before you jump me?</b></font>

505
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:15,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back in junior high,
your little girl acted like</b></font>

506
00:19:15,610 --> 00:19:17,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>such a mess
whenever we were around,</b></font>

507
00:19:17,490 --> 00:19:19,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it was hard not
to get pissed at her.</b></font>

508
00:19:20,330 --> 00:19:22,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you shoulda seen her
at the beach the other day.</b></font>

509
00:19:23,750 --> 00:19:26,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She came right up to me
and said hello.</b></font>

510
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:28,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Way it used to be,
she'd shut down anytime</b></font>

511
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:30,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I took a step near her.</b></font>

512
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:32,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Till she met these guys.</b></font>

513
00:19:32,380 --> 00:19:35,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I had to guess, they're
the ones who changed it.</b></font>

514
00:19:36,590 --> 00:19:39,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you're wondering why,
she probably went to Hachimitsu</b></font>

515
00:19:39,810 --> 00:19:41,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to meet people like them.</b></font>

516
00:19:41,430 --> 00:19:42,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

517
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Dad.
-[gasps]</b></font>

518
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:46,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get it.</b></font>

519
00:19:46,690 --> 00:19:48,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This all scares you.</b></font>

520
00:19:48,940 --> 00:19:51,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I am not going anywhere.</b></font>

521
00:19:51,150 --> 00:19:52,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can take care of myself.</b></font>

522
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:54,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can do more than you know.</b></font>

523
00:19:54,990 --> 00:19:56,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please don't worry anymore.</b></font>

524
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:58,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise I'll be fine.</b></font>

525
00:20:00,330 --> 00:20:01,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course...</b></font>

526
00:20:01,910 --> 00:20:03,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I still need you.</b></font>

527
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:06,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I am going back on Monday.</b></font>

528
00:20:06,420 --> 00:20:08,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hachimitsu's my home.</b></font>

529
00:20:08,170 --> 00:20:10,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

530
00:20:10,590 --> 00:20:12,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
Uka...lift your head.</b></font>

531
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:15,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

532
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:16,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

533
00:20:16,630 --> 00:20:18,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] I apologize
for the misunderstanding.</b></font>

534
00:20:19,010 --> 00:20:20,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

535
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:22,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please...
look after my daughter.</b></font>

536
00:20:22,930 --> 00:20:24,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

537
00:20:24,770 --> 00:20:25,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

538
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:28,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hello!
My name is Ayumi Endou.</b></font>

539
00:20:28,350 --> 00:20:31,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a Sagittarius,
and I live with my mom, dad,</b></font>

540
00:20:31,110 --> 00:20:32,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and one older sister.</b></font>

541
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:33,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And my pet bunny!</b></font>

542
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:36,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I may dress a little crazy,
but I am sane!</b></font>

543
00:20:36,530 --> 00:20:37,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She'll be fine with me!</b></font>

544
00:20:38,070 --> 00:20:39,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I love her!</b></font>

545
00:20:39,530 --> 00:20:40,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Oh, my turn!</b></font>

546
00:20:40,870 --> 00:20:42,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm Yuru Hashimoto!</b></font>

547
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My name's weird,
but my parents are normal!</b></font>

548
00:20:44,620 --> 00:20:46,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] [sighs]
Serina Kanno!</b></font>

549
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:48,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a Gemini.
Blood type B.</b></font>

550
00:20:48,500 --> 00:20:50,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I love Uka, too!</b></font>

551
00:20:50,420 --> 00:20:52,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
So...how'd I do?</b></font>

552
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:54,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nailed it.</b></font>

553
00:20:54,300 --> 00:20:56,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm Kai, I'm an Aquarius.</b></font>

554
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:59,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And while I may be a pissant,
I take care of her.</b></font>

555
00:21:00,140 --> 00:21:03,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD] Not quite ready
to accept you so easily.</b></font>

556
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:04,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

557
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Dad.</b></font>

558
00:21:05,770 --> 00:21:06,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

559
00:21:07,060 --> 00:21:08,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mom.</b></font>

560
00:21:08,350 --> 00:21:09,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

561
00:21:09,810 --> 00:21:11,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is it.</b></font>

562
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:12,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

563
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:18,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the new world
I've found.</b></font>

564
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

565
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:24,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

